<title>SINGAPORE: India buys 855,000 T diesel in July tender-traders.</title>
<headline>India buys 855,000 T diesel in July tender-traders.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp (IOC) has bought 855,000 tonnes of diesel in 19 cargoes in its July tender, traders said on Friday.</p>
</text>
